ication."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"2. Information We Collect"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when you register on the app. This includes:"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"2.1 Personal Details"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Identity:"}]," First name, last name, email address, and phone number."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Profile Data:"}]," Profile pictures, bios, and service categories."]}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"2.2 Location Data (Prominent Disclosure)"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Gigz requires access to your location to function as a hyper-local marketplace."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"For Clients:"}]," We access your location while the app is in use to show you nearby service providers and relevant gigs in your area."]}],"$L6"]}],"$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17"]}]}],null,"$L18"]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,"$19"]},null,false,null],"$L1a",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$1b",["$L1c"]],"S":true,"h":null,"r":"$undefined","s":"$undefined","a":"$undefined","l":"$undefined","p":"$undefined","d":"$undefined","b":"3RSarusEJUlArBvWR8yOU"}
